goal: project management = context management
objective: Evidence mutations report only durable state changes
value: History and agent receipts remain trustworthy and token-efficient
impact: Eliminates phantom evidence mutations across SDK and CLI
outcome: Idempotent linked-resource operations are observably idempotent
