  "2026-08-02T06:48:02.175Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all open, closed, and canceled PM items for duplicate linked file changed, no-op changed true, idempotent files/docs, and deduplicated add. Closed pm-e0ab and pm-45mb are adjacent but do not own the current files/docs mutation path. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/867."
  "2026-08-02T07:13:26.021Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: repeated files/docs additions now use skipNoop and actual changed fields, preserving item bytes and append-only history when normalized evidence is unchanged."
