  "2026-08-02T11:28:19.574Z","harness:codex","Repository-wide verification: 418 test files and 6,703 tests passed under the sandboxed coverage runner with exact 100% statements (47,529/47,529), branches (34,246/34,246), functions (9,673/9,673), and lines (46,119/46,119). No coverage thresholds, exclusions, or ignore counts were weakened."
  "2026-08-02T11:35:46.046Z","harness:codex","Packed-consumer acceptance: pnpm smoke:npx passed the generated tarball across 15 packaged modules. An independent tarball was then installed from unrelated root /tmp/tmp.0PKR29g4Dz into separate npm and Bun consumers with isolated project/global trackers; both initialized, created items, added evidence, and returned files lookup total=1. npm additionally proved atomic files/docs replacement and exact repeated evidence changed=false."
